WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.648 --> 00:00:10.824
99% of faces are asymmetrical, and with age, sagging on one side often becomes more pronounced.

2
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.584
Before styling, we carefully assess which side of the face looks better and sags less.

3
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:23.856
The left side of the face, governed by the emotional brain, tends to look softer and more attractive, so we sometimes favor it,

4
00:00:24.192 --> 00:00:32.928
but ultimately we choose a part direction — like a 7:3 or 6:4 diagonal part — based on each person's bone structure to hide flaws and highlight strengths.

5
00:00:33.264 --> 00:00:40.920
At the prior consultation, you'll see the difference between both sides in the mirror yourself, so you can choose the direction that flatters you most.
